From: Ze kernel maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] pppox: preserve target-net permission at original channel capture

Apply immediately after frozen0011 (e706df56). The legacy ATTCHAN producer
requires CAP_NET_ADMIN in its target net's user namespace. Preserve that check
for capture into an unbound file, whose open permission alone is insufficient.

diff --git a/drivers/net/ppp/ppp_generic.c b/drivers/net/ppp/ppp_generic.c
--- a/drivers/net/ppp/ppp_generic.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ppp/ppp_generic.c
@@ -3260,3 +3260,5 @@
 	if (file->f_op != &ppp_device_fops)
 		return -EBADF;
+	if (!ns_capable(net->user_ns, CAP_NET_ADMIN))
+		return -EPERM;
 	pch = ppp_channel_get_original(chan);

